{"sourceUrl":"https://sxy.cpu.edu.cn/b9/94/c8793a244116/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:08.753518+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sxy.cpu.edu.cn/b9/94/c8793a244116/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span><span><span>根据学校研究生院《中国药科大学</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名通知》（药大研函〔</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>〕</span></span></span></span><span><span>34</span></span><span><span><span><span>号）和学院《中国药科大学国际医药商学院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名通知》的有关规定和要求，依据学院第一批次推免生预报名和复试情况，现开展第二批次接收硕士推免生预报名及复试工作，有关事项通知如下。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>一、报名专业</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>我院第二批次可接收硕士推免生报名的专业为：</span></span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>学位类别</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><strong>专业名称</strong></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>105500</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>药学（管理药学）</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>105500</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>药学（生物经济学）</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>专业学位</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>105500</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>药学（医药投资管理）</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><span><span><strong>（二次报名仅限以上专业及硕士推免，不接收其它专业和直博生报名）</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>二、报名对象</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>已报名并参加过我院第一批次预推免复试的考生不得在本批次相同专业（方向）重复报名。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>入选我校“</span></span></span></span><span><span>3+1+X”</span></span><span><span><span><span>本研贯通人才培养直通车项目且考核合格的学生，应报名参加各学院、各机构的推免生预选拔及复试考核，复试合格且在全国推免服务系统中实际拟录取的考生，方可进入我校“</span></span></span></span><span><span>3+1+X”</span></span><span><span><span><span>本研贯通培养体系。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>三、报名方式</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>获得推荐免试资格的全国各院校</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生可在</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span><span><span>日至</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span>00</span></span><span><span><span><span>登录我校推免生预报名系统（</span></span></span></span><span><span>http://yzs.cpu.edu.cn/logon</span></span><span><span><span><span>），如实填写各项信息并提交材料，报名项目选择“推免生预报名”。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院对申请人资格进行审核，并于</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span><span><span>日上午</span></span></span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span>00</span></span><span><span><span><span>前向入围的学生在系统中发放通知，未收到通知者即未入选，不再另行通知。收到通知的学生请于</span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>小时内在登录系统回复确认是否参加，逾时未回复者视为自动放弃。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>四、报名材料</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>、身份证及在读学生证（必填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>、由所在学校院系的教务部门开具的本科学习成绩单（必填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>、就读国家级一流本科专业、理科基地班、生科基地班、拔尖计划的专业证明（符合条件者必填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、本科推荐环节成绩排名情况（必填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>、外语水平证明，如</span></span></span></span><span><span>CET-4</span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span><span><span>、雅思、托福、专业英语等（必填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>、学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）（选填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>、获得各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书（选填）；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span><span><span>、个人简历：限</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>页，应包含科研经历及获奖情况（必填）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>五、考核安排</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>第二批次考核采用线下现场复试方式，初定于</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>18-19</span></span><span><span><span><span>日进行，具体时间、地点等另行通知，请参加复试的学生关注报名系统、学院网站、手机短信、邮件信息，报名及复试期间保持手机通讯和邮件接收畅通，始终联系不上者，视为放弃本次复试。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>参加考核面试的学生提前准备</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>5</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>份个人简历，面试前提供给学科组专家。</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>考核复试前，考生向学院提交《中国药科大学</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生诚信复试承诺书》、《中国药科大学考生思想政治表现、自然情况审查表》原件。《中国药科大学考生思想政治表现、自然情况审查表》签字盖章原件来不及于复试前提交的，可于</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>21</span></span><span><span><span><span>日前补寄至学院。邮寄地址：南京市江宁区龙眠大道</span></span></span></span><span><span>639</span></span><span><span><span><span>号，中国药科大学江宁校区经管文楼</span></span></span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span><span>室 刘老师收，电话</span></span></span></span><span><span>025-86185036</span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>为保证政审表安全寄达，最好使用</span></span></span></span><span><span>EMS</span></span><span><span><span><span>邮寄，信封表面醒目地写上“政审表”三字，政审表中各项审查结论、鉴定人签字都不能遗漏，红章原件。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>六、其它</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>国际医药商学院研究生招生委员会负责本次活动的组织领导工作，制定活动方案并组织实施。联系人：刘老师，联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span>025-86185036</span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>                         <span><span><span>中国药科大学国际医药商学院</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>                                 2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"d99398e4f8a715084848c2133facf4f1f256a5dff96d972b2ee237aaa162ce6c","textLength":1402,"sourceSha256":"2c00ca6d2d0401b68b2fff8dfacd665aa9dad6f942ef582eec9eab4a872d379b","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ccd461e9be02737648cc","title":"2026年中国药科大学国际医药商学院2027年接收推免生第二批次预报名及复试通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:08.753518+00:00"}
